any", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to invest my money in shares.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing About a City and Its Landmarks", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To write a descriptive paragraph about a landmark you include the following about the landmark:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "  <ul>  \t<li>Name and location<br/> Example: <span class=\"italic\">The New York Stock Exchange is located downtown.</span></li>    <li>Who designed it, when it was built <br/> (use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> tense) </li>  \t  Example: <span class=\"italic\">It was built in 1817; the group Intercontinental Exchange started the construction.</span>  <li>A description of the interior and exterior<br/>   Example: <span class=\"italic\">It has an amazing view; there's a lot of noise; you see large rooms in it; it's one of the tallest buildings in Manhattan. </span>  </li>  \t  <li>Interesting facts <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">They ring a bell to start and finish the day.</span></li>    <li>Your opinion (what did you think about the landmark?) <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\"> This building is impressive, it's a total eye-opener!</span></li>    </ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research a landmark anywhere in the world.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the information to your class or a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name of landmark:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"typ