nd sold by brokers \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Who built the landmark? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Trowbridge & Livingston were the architects\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is it? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Located on Wall Street in lower Manhattan \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When was it built? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"March 8, 1817 \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What does it look like? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Large, gray exterior modern interior \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is the landmark natural (like the Grand Canyon) or human-made (like the Eiffel Tower)? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Human-made Made a National Historic Landmark in 1978   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is special or important about it?  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Largest Stock Exchange in the World \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is/are an/some interesting fact(s)?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Also known as \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Big Board</span>\\\" 1,867 companies are on the stock exchange\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Instructions:\n<br/>\n\n<span class=\"bullet\">Imagine you research this information about the NY Stock Exchange.</span><br/><span class=\"bullet\">  \tWrite a paragraph about a landmark using the information provided.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Include a topic sentence, supporting sentence and a concluding sentence.</span>     <br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\"> When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.