was a real eye-opener. We arrived in time to hear the opening bell that marks the beginning of each trading day.</p>", "time": "9000"}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "A broker then  led the tour group through a maze of offices onto the trading floor. We could see the big television screens with data above us. The brokers were busy shouting and waving their arms across the room.</p>", "time": "27000"}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "They were busy buying and selling shares. Anyone visiting New York should spend a few hours watching these people work. It's a must-see! I still don't understand how people can work with all that noise!<br />", "time": "42000"}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "I'm off to see the Empire State Building.<br />\nTake care.<br /><br />Sal", "time": "57500"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le13ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">How to write about landmarks</span>", "time": "5000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What you do do first? Time to research!</span>", "time": "16000"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Let's organize the information</span>", "time": "103000"}, {"image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What should you remember to do?</span>", "time": "128000"}], "video_src": "engenn4le13ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}